  "description": "The Strider 14x Convertible Bike is built to help kids learn balance and quickly master all the necessary skills to begin pedaling before their peers.\n\nTo start, the 14x is set to balance mode. This helps children who haven’t been on a bike before to learn balance first. It also helps experienced Strider riders to gain confidence and practice balancing on a bigger bike before adding pedals.\n\nWe know kids sprout up faster than fertilized weeds. To that end, this convertible bike includes highly adjustable handlebars and a seat sized just right. With easy assembly, your kiddo is rolling in seconds. We even include the tools you’ll need.\n\nNext, attach the Easy-Ride Pedal Conversion Kit (sold separately). VOILÁ!\n\nWitness your kiddo seamlessly switching back and forth between striding around the narrow pedals and practicing pedaling. This is a confidence boosting moment.\n\nThe Strider Learn-To-Ride process turns gaps into overlaps, which guarantees success. Watch your rider build coordination and more courage after every ride.\n\nNow your kid is pedaling around the neighborhood thinking you’re the superhero for getting them the best convertible bike out there.\n\nWhen your kiddo rides a Strider, they experience success that stays with them throughout life and onward to new adventures!",
